  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/ironjetpacks?source=curseforge\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/cucumber_required.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"840\" height=\"84\"></a></span></p><p style=\"display:flex\"><a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252firon-jetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252firon-jetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252firon-jetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fdocs%252fironjetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=docs&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fwiki%252fironjetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">铁质喷气背包 (Iron Jetpacks) 是一款功能丰富且易于使用的现代喷气背包模组。</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>特性</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完全可自定义！所有喷气背包的属性和统计信息均可配置，并且您可以添加自己的喷气背包！ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fdocs%252fironjetpacks%252fjetpack-json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(文档)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自带一系列由各种原版和模组材料制成的默认喷气背包。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用锻造能量 (Forge Energy / FE) 驱动，以实现广泛的模组兼容性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">油门控制！可在飞行中调节空中移动速度！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过内置HUD查看当前的能源、引擎、悬停和油门状态。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新增！</strong> 支持Curios饰品栏！可将喷气背包作为饰品装备。</span></li>\n</ul>",
